  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference consolidated T1D dataset for ML research — 3,135 subjects and 1,228 patient-years across 21 source datasets in a standardised Parquet schema. Eliminates the per-dataset preprocessing burden that has fragmented T1D algorithm development. Public subset (1,895 subjects) accessible via free account; full dataset via individual DUAs with source dataset owners. CC BY 4.0 for the public portion. Adopt as the primary training and evaluation corpus for glucose prediction, digital twin, and AID algorithm development.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-15",
